    "name": {
      "value": "Curandero"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "botd"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You learned the healing arts of your community wielding your ceremonial chonta, a tool you carved yourself and imbued with sacred oils and herbs. This process opened your eyes to ailments of a more mystical nature: malefic spirits, haunts, possession, and more. You likely took up adventuring to combat these horrors, or you may have fled an evil beyond your power to vanquish.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Medicine skill and the Herbalism Lore skill. You gain the Inoculation skill feat."
    },
